div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="go('match')">▶ &nbsp; PLAY HIGHLIGHTS</button></article><article class="card formcard"><div class="cardhead"><h3>Season form</h3><span class="tiny">LAST 5</span></div><div class="formlist">${Array.from({length:5},(_,i)=>{let r=s.lastResults?.[i]||'—';return `<div class="formdot ${r==='W'?'win':r==='D'?'draw':r==='L'?'loss':''}">${r}</div>`}).join('')}</div><div class="formcaption">${s.lastResult}</div><div class="streak"><span>CAREER APPEARANCES</span><strong>${s.played}</strong></div></article></section><h2 class="section-title">Make your move</h2><section class="quickgrid"><article class="card quick" onclick="go('life')"><div class="quickicon">🏋️</div><b>Train & recover</b><span>Get match-fit at the gym</span></article><article class="card quick" onclick="go('clubhouse')"><div class="quickicon">🛍️</div><b>Hit the mall</b><span>Find a fit that feels like you</span></article><article class="card quick" onclick="go('clubhouse');setTimeout(()=>clubTab('transfers'),0)"><div class="quickicon">✈️</div><b>Transfer market</b><span>Find your next club</span></article><article class="card quick" onclick="go('life')"><div class="quickicon">📺</div><b>Switch off</b><span>TV, games & downtime</span></article></section><section class="dashboard-bottom"><article class="card news"><div class="cardhead"><h3>Touchline talk</h3><span class="tiny">LATEST</span></div><div class="newsrow"><span class="newsicon">📰</span><div><b>${s.played?`${s.name} turns heads after ${s.lastResult.includes('Win')?'a standout performance':'a big week'} for ${s.club}`:'New season, new story: the academy prospect to watch'}</b><p>Club insiders are excited to see what the season brings.</p></div></div></article><article class="card contract"><div class="cardhead"><h3>Contract details</h3><span class="tiny">${s.contract} WEEKS LEFT</span></div><div class="contractline"><span>Weekly wage</span><strong>${money(s.salary)}</strong></div><div class="contractline"><span>